                  "termSlug": "tibs"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Tibs"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is one of the quickest meals in the Ethiopian kitchen. Tender beef strips hit a very hot pan with onions and peppers, then cook in just a few minutes. The fresh rosemary is added at the end and gives the dish an aromatic lift that is distinctive to this preparation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A cast-iron skillet gives the best sear. Get the pan very hot before the meat goes in so the beef colours quickly rather than steaming."
          }
        ]
      },
